    "circulation_reference_plan": "calibration/circulation_audit_20261026/plan.json",
    "physical_definition": "Hold all r39 coefficients, shared wind, calibrated total capacity, normalized moist-profile capacity fractions, boundaries, mass/vertical transport, land and actual lower-ocean evaporation, drying, conservative storms and planetary parameters fixed. Preserve old layer rainfall as exact control. In corrected option, local dynamical gate and supersaturation overflow remain layer-specific, but the empirical whole-column convection coefficient is computed once from total W/Ws and applies to both Wi. Thus total convective rain equals its original column relation, including the 0.1mm dry-water numerical floor, rather than the sum of a convex exponential on independently varying layer humidities. Falling non-overflow rain in both layers is attenuated using actual lower-layer RH, representing the air it traverses, with the original subcloud evaporation coefficient. Overflow remains unattenuated. No new physical coefficient; no latent-heat, explicit cloud-plume, ice or vertical-energy claim. Old proportional profile remains equivalent to roundoff. Previous parcel experiment is not coupled in this study. Additionally upper non-overflow rain removes its gross amount from upper vapor; the fraction re-evaporated in lower air is added to actual lower water, not retained aloft. The pair of internal precipitation-transfer terms cancels exactly in the total-column equation. Lower locally formed rain retains its original effective attenuation. Ground rain is the attenuated dynamic/convective total plus unattenuated overflow; both layer equations include the signed precipitation transfer. This routing introduces no water source or fitted parameter. Proportional-profile equivalence refers to total ground rain, not the two individual layer losses.",
    "control": "42 actual coupled regional integrations:7original r39 exact monthly climate/native-wind controls;7exact common-mass controls;7exact independent no-mixing controls;7exact independent5day-mixing controls; then14candidate runs. Historical NPZ fieldsets and every field must match exactly. All28controls precede new candidates. Preserve failures and never add profiles after outcomes.",
    "screen": "All strict numerical/conservative-vapor/storm checks and scaled column-mass residual<=1e-10 required. Same accuracy guards: S<=.995, mean rain ratio<=.99,T ratio<=1.01; NI rain ratio<=.95; Iran<=1.02; every other region S<=1.02. Actual integrated SST MAE increase<=.02C on identical observation-only masks, column speed max<=60m/s,p95<=25m/s. Fixed outside-wind guards: NI native partial-column vector RMSE improvement>=5%; Iberia ocean/EastAustralia lowland worsening<=2%, identical masks and areas. No additional candidate, weakened threshold or new validation sampling after outcomes. Also require two_layer_transport certificate with dry-column residual<=1e-10 and EACH branch wind maximum<=60m/s,p95<=25m/s (all primer/scored steps), rather than hiding a fast return in the weighted mean. Exactly2 fixed reservoir closures, with strict layer/column certificates throughout. Additionally predeclare Iberia ocean native monthly partial humidity protection against the rerun fixed-profile transport control: PW925-300 MAE and upper700-300/lower925-700 mean specific-humidity ratio MAE may each worsen at most2%, with identical native cells/areas. Observed anchor is not assimilated; use actual solved model water and model piecewise-uniform layer q integrated over exactly matched pressures. Exclude any footprint containing model below-ground925hPa. Full-column humidity ratio is not compared directly with partial observations. No new error limit or candidate after outcomes. Corrected scheme must be certified at every primer/scored step and at every later gate; same unchanged numerical and physical accuracy protections. Require conservative precipitation re-evaporation transfer certificate and absolute internal cancellation<=1e-10mm/day throughout.",
    "advance": "Best at most2 qualifiers advance through unchanged full31 policy_v2 and individual regional protections, integrated ocean/wind checks, paired28km four-region S<=1.01 plus NI rain<=.98 and established6 S<=1.01. All independent layer/column, mass, branch-speed and tracer certificates required at every stage. Repeat56km Iberia ocean humidity protection in the ocean gate; before adoption also run additional paired28km Iberia humidity control/candidate with same2% separate PW/shape limits (at most3 extra actual solves across2 finalists). Existing development sets remain reused, not independent validation. Fantasy/world qualification remains separate.",
    "publication": "42fixed actual Earth integrations,28historical controls then14candidate runs. At most2qualifiers may advance through unchanged full31/ocean/fine/established guards, including humidity. Publish every score/failure and matched maps as reused development evidence. No normal atlas climate/headline replacement unless separate release gates pass. Source-change stop and2h ceiling.",
